---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import StickyNav from "../components/StickyNav.astro";
import Footer from "../components/Footer.astro";
import CtaBanner from "../components/CtaBanner.astro";

import Reviews from "../components/Reviews.astro";
const phone = "tel:+14077343968";
const phoneDisplay = "407-734-3968";
---

<Layout
  title="Avalon Park Water Heater Replacement & Repair | Bonet Plumbing LLC"
  description="Water heater replacement, tankless conversion, and plumbing repair for Avalon Park homes in 32828. Homes built in the early 2000s are on their second or third water heater now. Licensed & insured (CFC1434246). Call 407-734-3968."
  breadcrumbs={[
    { name: "Home", url: "https://bonetplumbing.com/" },
    { name: "Service Areas", url: "https://bonetplumbing.com/#service-areas" },
    { name: "Avalon Park Water Heaters" }
  ]}
  geoPlacename="Avalon Park, Orlando, Florida"
  geoLat={28.5087}
  geoLng={-81.1551}
>
  <StickyNav />
  <main>
    <section class="bg-gradient-to-b from-primary/[0.03] via-white to-white py-16 md:py-24">
      <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4">
        <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-extrabold text-text leading-tight mb-4">
          Water Heater Replacement in Avalon Park — Built in the Early 2000s? You're Likely on Your Second or Third.
        </h1>
        <div class="w-16 h-1 bg-accent rounded-full mb-6"></div>
        <p class="text-lg text-text-secondary mb-8 max-w-2xl">
          Avalon Park was built out between 2000 and 2019 — roughly 2,447 single-family homes and 1,168 multi-family units across seven villages. A tank water heater in Florida's hard water lasts about 8 to 12 years, so if you bought here in the early days, the unit in your garage is almost certainly the second or third one this house has had. When it goes, we replace it same-day — from Downtown / Founders Square to the Original Village, South Village, and Avalon Lakes.
        </p>

        <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-3 mb-12">
          <a href={phone} class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-3 bg-accent hover:bg-accent-light text-white font-bold text-lg px-8 py-4 rounded-lg shadow-md transition-all duration-200 hover:shadow-lg">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M2.25 6.75c0 8.284 6.716 15 15 15h2.25a2.25 2.25 0 002.25-2.25v-1.372c0-.516-.351-.966-.852-1.091l-4.423-1.106c-.44-.11-.902.055-1.173.417l-.97 1.293c-.282.376-.769.542-1.21.38a12.035 12.035 0 01-7.143-7.143c-.162-.441.004-.928.38-1.21l1.293-.97c.363-.271.527-.734.417-1.173L6.963 3.102a1.125 1.125 0 00-1.091-.852H4.5A2.25 2.25 0 002.25 4.5v2.25z"/>
            </svg>
            Call Now: {phoneDisplay}
          </a>
          <a href="/#contact" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 bg-primary hover:bg-primary-light text-white font-bold text-lg px-8 py-4 rounded-lg shadow-md transition-all duration-200 hover:shadow-lg">
            Get a Free Estimate
          </a>
        </div>

        <!-- LEAD SERVICE: Water heater replacement -->
        <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-text mb-3">Water Heater Replacement — Our Bread and Butter in Avalon Park</h2>
        <p class="text-text-secondary mb-6 max-w-2xl">
          A tank that's leaking from the bottom, rusty hot water, popping and rumbling, or a pilot that won't stay lit — once a water heater hits the end of its life, replacement is the honest fix, not another repair bill. We carry quality units, install the same day in most cases, bring the connections up to code, and haul the old tank away. You'll know the price before we start.
          <!-- [VERIFY WITH OWNER]: any specific water-heater or install pricing / price ranges before adding numbers here -->
          <!-- [VERIFY WITH OWNER]: warranty terms or durations on installed units and on labor -->
        </p>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 mb-12">
          <div class="bg-surface border border-border rounded-xl p-6">
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-text mb-3">Same-Day Tank Replacement</h3>
            <p class="text-text-secondary text-sm leading-relaxed">If yours is leaking or past its prime, we swap it out the same day in most cases — quality unit, code upgrades, and old-unit haul-away included.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-surface border border-border rounded-xl p-6">
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-text mb-3">Repair When It Makes Sense</h3>
            <p class="text-text-secondary text-sm leading-relaxed">A bad thermostat, heating element, or gas valve on a newer unit is worth fixing. We'll tell you honestly whether a repair buys you real time or just delays the inevitable.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-surface border border-border rounded-xl p-6">
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-text mb-3">Expansion Tank & Code</h3>
            <p class="text-text-secondary text-sm leading-relaxed">A new heater on a closed system needs a properly sized thermal expansion tank and an up-to-code T&P discharge line. We handle the details inspectors look for.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-surface border border-border rounded-xl p-6">
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-text mb-3">Flushing & Maintenance</h3>
            <p class="text-text-secondary text-sm leading-relaxed">Central Florida's hard water lays down sediment fast, and that's what cooks a tank early. A regular flush quiets the rumble and helps your unit reach the far end of that 8-to-12-year window.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Tankless conversion -->
        <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-text mb-3">Thinking Tankless Instead?</h2>
        <p class="text-text-secondary mb-10 max-w-2xl">
          If your tank is due anyway, it's the natural moment to consider going tankless — endless hot water, a 15-to-20-year lifespan, lower energy bills, and a wall-mounted unit that gives you back the garage floor space. In an Avalon Park home it usually means upsizing the gas line and adding proper venting, which we handle as part of the job. We install Rinnai, Navien, and Rheem, and we'll size the unit to how your household actually uses hot water. <a href="/water-heater-services" class="text-accent hover:text-accent-light font-medium">See our full water heater &amp; tankless service &rarr;</a>
        </p>

        <CtaBanner
          heading="Water Heater Acting Up in Avalon Park?"
          sub="Free estimates, upfront pricing, and same-day service from a licensed local plumber."
        />

        <!-- Secondary services -->
        <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-text mb-6 mt-12">The Rest of What We Handle in Avalon Park</h2>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4 mb-12">
          <div class="bg-surface border border-border rounded-xl p-5">
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-text mb-2">Water Pressure & PRV Issues</h3>
            <p class="text-text-secondary text-sm">Pressure that's too low is annoying; pressure that's too high quietly wears out fixtures, appliances, and that new water heater. If your pressure-reducing valve has failed, we test it and replace it.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-surface border border-border rounded-xl p-5">
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-text mb-2">Water Treatment & Softeners</h3>
            <p class="text-text-secondary text-sm">The same hard water that shortens tank life leaves scale on fixtures and glassware. We install and service softeners and treatment systems to protect your plumbing and your new heater.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-surface border border-border rounded-xl p-5">
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-text mb-2">Drain Cleaning</h3>
            <p class="text-text-secondary text-sm">Slow sinks, gurgling showers, or a kitchen line that keeps backing up? We clear stoppages and get your drains flowing again — no guesswork, no mess left behind.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-surface border border-border rounded-xl p-5">
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-text mb-2">Fixture Installation & Repair</h3>
            <p class="text-text-secondary text-sm">Faucets, toilets, garbage disposals, hose bibs, and shower valves — repaired when we can, cleanly replaced when it's time for an upgrade.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-surface border border-border rounded-xl p-5">
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-text mb-2">General Plumbing Repair</h3>
            <p class="text-text-secondary text-sm">Leaks under the sink, a running toilet, a supply line that lets go — the everyday problems that need a licensed plumber who shows up and fixes it right.</p>
          </div>
          <a href="/alafaya-plumber" class="bg-primary/5 border border-primary/10 rounded-xl p-5 hover:shadow-md transition-shadow group flex flex-col justify-center">
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-text mb-2 group-hover:text-primary transition-colors">Need General Plumbing, Not Just Water Heaters?</h3>
            <p class="text-text-secondary text-sm">See our full Alafaya &amp; UCF plumbing page for repiping, slab leaks, sewer lines, and more across east Orange County. &rarr;</p>
          </a>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-primary/5 border border-primary/10 rounded-xl p-6 mb-10">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-text mb-3">What You Get</h2>
          <ul class="space-y-3">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-primary shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M4.5 12.75l6 6 9-13.5"/></svg>
              <span class="text-text-secondary text-sm">Your home is protected — licensed (CFC1434246) & fully insured in Florida</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-primary shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M4.5 12.75l6 6 9-13.5"/></svg>
              <span class="text-text-secondary text-sm">Same-day water heater replacement across all seven Avalon Park villages</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-primary shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M4.5 12.75l6 6 9-13.5"/></svg>
              <span class="text-text-secondary text-sm">You'll know the price before we start — no hidden fees, no surprises</span>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4">
          <a href={phone} class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-3 bg-accent hover:bg-accent-light text-white font-bold text-lg px-8 py-4 rounded-lg shadow-md transition-all duration-200 hover:shadow-lg">
            Call Now: {phoneDisplay}
          </a>
          <a href="/#contact" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 bg-primary hover:bg-primary-light text-white font-bold text-lg px-8 py-4 rounded-lg shadow-md transition-all duration-200 hover:shadow-lg">
            Get a Free Estimate
          </a>
        </div>

        <!-- FAQ Section -->
        <div class="mt-16 pt-8 border-t border-border">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-text mb-6">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
          <div class="space-y-6">
            <div>
              <h3 class="font-bold text-text mb-2">My Avalon Park home is from the early 2000s — does my water heater need replacing?</h3>
              <p class="text-text-secondary text-sm leading-relaxed">A tank water heater in Central Florida typically lasts 8 to 12 years, and hard water pushes many toward the short end. If your home was built when Avalon Park first went up and the heater has never been changed, it's well past that window — and if it's already needing repairs, replacement is usually the better investment.</p>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="font-bold text-text mb-2">Can you replace a water heater the same day?</h3>
              <p class="text-text-secondary text-sm leading-relaxed">In most cases, yes. We keep quality tank units on hand, and for a straightforward swap we can replace it, bring the connections up to code, and haul the old one away in a single visit. Tankless conversions take a bit more planning because of gas and venting.</p>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="font-bold text-text mb-2">Should I switch to tankless instead of another tank?</h3>
              <p class="text-text-secondary text-sm leading-relaxed">For a lot of families it's worth it — endless hot water, a longer lifespan, lower energy bills, and reclaimed floor space. In most Avalon Park homes it requires upsizing the gas line and new venting, which we handle as part of the install. We'll assess your home and give you honest numbers before you commit.</p>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="font-bold text-text mb-2">Which Avalon Park villages do you serve?</h3>
              <p class="text-text-secondary text-sm leading-relaxed">All of them — Downtown / Founders Square, the Original Village, South Village, and Avalon Lakes, and the surrounding 32828 neighborhoods.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <nav class="mt-16 pt-8 border-t border-border" aria-label="Related pages">
          <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-text mb-4">Nearby & Related</h2>
          <ul class="flex flex-wrap gap-3">
            <li><a href="/alafaya-plumber" class="text-accent hover:text-accent-light font-medium text-sm transition-colors">Alafaya / UCF Plumber</a></li>
            <li><a href="/water-heater-services" class="text-accent hover:text-accent-light font-medium text-sm transition-colors">Water Heaters & Tankless</a></li>
            <li><a href="/east-orlando-plumber" class="text-accent hover:text-accent-light font-medium text-sm transition-colors">East Orlando</a></li>
          </ul>
        </nav>
      </div>
    </section>
    <Reviews />
  </main>

  <!-- FAQPage Schema -->
  <script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify({
    "@context": "https://schema.org",
    "@type": "FAQPage",
    "mainEntity": [
      {
        "@type": "Question",
        "name": "My Avalon Park home is from the early 2000s — does my water heater need replacing?",
        "acceptedAnswer": {
          "@type": "Answer",
          "text": "A tank water heater in Central Florida typically lasts 8 to 12 years, and hard water pushes many toward the short end. If your home was built when Avalon Park first went up and the heater has never been changed, it's well past that window — and if it's already needing repairs, replacement is usually the better investment."
        }
      },
      {
        "@type": "Question",
        "name": "Can you replace a water heater the same day?",
        "acceptedAnswer": {
          "@type": "Answer",
          "text": "In most cases, yes. We keep quality tank units on hand, and for a straightforward swap we can replace it, bring the connections up to code, and haul the old one away in a single visit. Tankless conversions take a bit more planning because of gas and venting."
        }
      },
      {
        "@type": "Question",
        "name": "Should I switch to tankless instead of another tank?",
        "acceptedAnswer": {
          "@type": "Answer",
          "text": "For a lot of families it's worth it — endless hot water, a longer lifespan, lower energy bills, and reclaimed floor space. In most Avalon Park homes it requires upsizing the gas line and new venting, which we handle as part of the install. We'll assess your home and give you honest numbers before you commit."
        }
      },
      {
        "@type": "Question",
        "name": "Which Avalon Park villages do you serve?",
        "acceptedAnswer": {
          "@type": "Answer",
          "text": "All of them — Downtown / Founders Square, the Original Village, South Village, and Avalon Lakes, and the surrounding 32828 neighborhoods."
        }
      }
